Spirit Healer Dialog
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        ((Triggering unit) is in SpiritHealers.) Equal to True
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Distance between (Position of (Triggering unit)) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 500.00
                (Distance between (Position of (Triggering unit)) and (Position of Zulkis)) Less than or equal to 500.00
    Actions
        Set VariableSet SpiritHealer = (Triggering unit)
        Countdown Timer - Pause SpiritHealerRevealTimer
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of SpiritHealer)
        Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to VarPoint over 1.00 seconds
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
        Unit - Make SpiritHealer face Nazgrek over 0.75 seconds
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from SpiritHealer named Spirit Healer: Play No sound and display I can restore your ....  Modify duration: Set to 2.00 seconds and Wait
        Wait 2.00 seconds
        Dialog - Clear SpiritHealerDialog
        Dialog - Change the title of SpiritHealerDialog to Restore items
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                RestoreItemsPossibleN Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Dialog - Create a dialog button for SpiritHealerDialog labelled - Restore Nazgrek's...
                Set VariableSet SpiritHealerDialogRestoN = (Last created dialog Button)
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                RestoreItemsPossibleZ Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Dialog - Create a dialog button for SpiritHealerDialog labelled - Restore Zul'ki's ...
                Set VariableSet SpiritHealerDialogRestoZ = (Last created dialog Button)
            Else - Actions
        Dialog - Create a dialog button for SpiritHealerDialog labelled - Cancel
        Set VariableSet SpiritHealerDialogCancel = (Last created dialog Button)
        Cinematic - Enable user control for (All players).
        Dialog - Show SpiritHealerDialog for Player 1 (Red)
